>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father 2XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>80-89 kg / 176.4-196.2 lbs</td>\n<td>175-180 cm / 68.9-70.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father 3XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>87.5-97.5 kg / 192.9-215 lbs</td>\n<td>175-188 cm / 68.9-74 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father 4XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>97.5-115 kg / 215-253.5 lbs</td>\n<td>178-195 cm / 70.1-76.8 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Pastel Tulip brings a soft vacation mood to family matching: floaty mom-and-girl dresses, a clean white dad tee with the same watercolor floral panel, and baby romper rows for the smallest matching moment. The print is colorful without feeling loud, so it works for seaside photos, garden brunches, and relaxed summer plans.</p>\n\n<p>The attached fit chart is the source of truth for every listed size. It provides recommended height and weight ranges, so garment-measurement columns are left blank instead of guessed.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Full family sizing:</strong> Baby, child, mother, and father rows are all backed by the attached chart.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Coordinated pieces:</strong> Dress, shirt, and baby romper Types keep each purchasable piece clear.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Pastel floral print:</strong> Pink tulip-style blooms and green watercolor leaves create a soft photo-ready look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Summer friendly:</strong> Strappy dresses and a short-sleeve tee silhouette suit warm-weather plans.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Draft-only listing:</strong> Built unpublished for final image, fabric, and inventory review.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Select the Type and Size for each family member to build a coordinated Pastel Tulip look for your next sunny memory.</p>",
